ChronosMatch — Low-Latency HFT Matching Engine & Real-Time Dashboard

1. Project Overview

Project Name: ChronosMatch
Project Type: High-Frequency Trading (HFT) Matching Engine
Primary Goal: Build a low-latency order-matching engine with efficient memory communication, trade execution, performance monitoring, and a real-time web dashboard.

ChronosMatch aims to process buy and sell orders efficiently using price-time priority, maintain a consistent order book, record executions, measure processing latency, and visualize engine activity through a monitoring dashboard.

2. Project Objectives

- Develop a reliable limit order matching engine.
- Implement price-time priority order matching.
- Support partial fills, cancellations, and order rejection.
- Build an efficient order-book data structure.
- Explore zero-copy inter-process communication (IPC).
- Measure throughput and latency percentiles.
- Develop a real-time dashboard for monitoring engine performance.
- Implement automated testing and reproducible benchmarks.
- Document architecture, technical challenges, and future optimizations.

