Architecture Principles

- Keep the matching engine independent of the user interface.
- Process orders deterministically.
- Keep disk I/O and dashboard rendering outside the matching hot path.
- Publish monitoring events asynchronously.
- Validate all incoming orders.
- Measure performance instead of assuming improvements.
- Protect order-book consistency and message integrity.

