Conclusion

ChronosMatch combines order matching, efficient inter-process communication, performance measurement, and real-time monitoring in a single project. The development strategy prioritizes correctness first, observability second, and measured optimization third.

The two-week roadmap provides a structured path from the initial engine implementation to a connected dashboard and a review-ready benchmark report. Production-grade HFT performance remains a separate engineering milestone requiring rigorous profiling, testing, and validation.
